* Iterative Vertex Relaxation (Snakes / Active Contours)
* How it works: Initialize a fine-polygon loop around the disks. In a loop, move each vertex slightly inward toward the center. If a vertex intercepts a disk boundary, project it back out to the disk's exact surface radius.
